    I WANT TO KIND OF AUTOMATIC SLIDE FOR PRODCT THEY ARE ON SALE  WITH PRICE AND BOTTON  TO PAY , LOOKS PERFECT  I JUST WANT TO SEE 3 product in disktop and 2 in mobile version , can you at least make it stylish put bouth sale product in the midle and the bottom i want it in green clour
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-sale-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.background_color }} 0%, {{ block.settings.background_gradient_color }} 100%);
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-track-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 20px 0;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc((100% - {{ block.settings.card_gap | times: 2 }}px) / 3);
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(18, 89, 32, 0.1) 0%, rgba(52, 127, 67, 0.1) 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(18, 89, 32, 0.25);
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-sale-slider-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 15px;
    right: 15px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.badge_color }} 0%, {{ block.settings.badge_gradient_color }} 100%);
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(18, 89, 32, 0.3);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 25px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.product_title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.product_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 15px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    font-weight: 600;
    min-height: 50px;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.compare_price_color }};
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.button_color }} 0%, {{ block.settings.button_gradient_color }} 100%);
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_text_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(18, 89, 32, 0.3);
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(18, 89, 32, 0.4);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }} 0%, {{ block.settings.button_color }} 100%);
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 25px;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.nav_button_color }} 0%, {{ block.settings.nav_gradient_color }} 100%);
    color: {{ block.settings.nav_button_icon_color }};
    border: none;
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(18, 89, 32, 0.3);
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(18, 89, 32, 0.4);
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.3;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    transform: scale(1);
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_color }};
    opacity: 0.3;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1.3);
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-empty-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    color: #666;
  }

  .ai-sale-slider-empty-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-sale-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc((100% - {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px) / 2);
    }

    .ai-sale-slider-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-sale-slider-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-sale-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }

    .ai-sale-slider-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 15px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<sale-products-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-sale-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-sale-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.title != blank or block.settings.subtitle != blank %}
      <div class="ai-sale-slider-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-sale-slider-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subtitle != blank %}
          <p class="ai-sale-slider-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subtitle }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% assign sale_products = collections.all.products | where: 'compare_at_price' %}
    
    {% if sale_products.size > 0 %}
      <div class="ai-sale-slider-track-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-sale-slider-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-track>
          {% for product in sale_products limit: block.settings.product_limit %}
            <div class="ai-sale-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-sale-slider-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if product.featured_image %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                    alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                    class="ai-sale-slider-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="600"
                    height="600"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                {% endif %}
                
                {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                  {% assign discount = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price %}
                  <span class="ai-sale-slider-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">-{{ discount }}%</span>
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              <div class="ai-sale-slider-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-sale-slider-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>
                
                <div class="ai-sale-slider-price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <span class="ai-sale-slider-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                  {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                    <span class="ai-sale-slider-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>

                <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-sale-slider-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.button_text }}
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-sale-slider-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-sale-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-prev aria-label="Previous slide">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M15 18L9 12L15 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>

        <div class="ai-sale-slider-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-dots></div>

        <button class="ai-sale-slider-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-next aria-label="Next slide">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M9 18L15 12L9 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="ai-sale-slider-empty-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        <p>No products on sale at the moment. Add sale prices to your products to display them here.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</sale-products-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class SaleProductsSlider{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.currentIndex = 0;
        this.autoplayInterval = null;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('[data-track]');
        this.prevButton = this.querySelector('[data-prev]');
        this.nextButton = this.querySelector('[data-next]');
        this.dotsContainer = this.querySelector('[data-dots]');
        
        if (!this.track) return;

        this.cards = Array.from(this.track.children);
        this.totalSlides = this.cards.length;
        
        if (this.totalSlides === 0) return;

        this.slidesPerView = this.getSlidesPerView();
        this.maxIndex = Math.max(0, this.totalSlides - this.slidesPerView);

        this.createDots();
        this.setupEventListeners();
        this.updateSlider();
        this.startAutoplay();

        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
          this.slidesPerView = this.getSlidesPerView();
          this.maxIndex = Math.max(0, this.totalSlides - this.slidesPerView);
          this.currentIndex = Math.min(this.currentIndex, this.maxIndex);
          this.updateSlider();
        });
      }

      getSlidesPerView() {
        const width = window.innerWidth;
        if (width <= 749) return 2;
        return 3;
      }

      createDots() {
        if (!this.dotsContainer) return;
        
        this.dotsContainer.innerHTML = '';
        const numDots = this.maxIndex + 1;
        
        for (let i = 0; i < numDots; i++) {
          const dot = document.createElement('button');
          dot.className = 'ai-sale-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
          dot.setAttribute('aria-label', `Go to slide ${i + 1}`);
          dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
            this.currentIndex = i;
            this.updateSlider();
            this.resetAutoplay();
          });
          this.dotsContainer.appendChild(dot);
        }
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        if (this.prevButton) {
          this.prevButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
            this.prev();
            this.resetAutoplay();
          });
        }

        if (this.nextButton) {
          this.nextButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
            this.next();
            this.resetAutoplay();
          });
        }

        this.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => this.stopAutoplay());
        this.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => this.startAutoplay());
      }

      prev() {
        if (this.currentIndex > 0) {
          this.currentIndex--;
          this.updateSlider();
        }
      }

      next() {
        if (this.currentIndex < this.maxIndex) {
          this.currentIndex++;
          this.updateSlider();
        }
      }

      updateSlider() {
        const cardWidth = this.cards[0].offsetWidth;
        const gap = {{ block.settings.card_gap }};
        const offset = -(this.currentIndex * (cardWidth + gap));
        
        this.track.style.transform = `translateX(${offset}px)`;

        if (this.prevButton) {
          this.prevButton.disabled = this.currentIndex === 0;
        }

        if (this.nextButton) {
          this.nextButton.disabled = this.currentIndex >= this.maxIndex;
        }

        const dots = this.dotsContainer.querySelectorAll('.ai-sale-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
          if (index === this.currentIndex) {
            dot.classList.add('active');
          } else {
            dot.classList.remove('active');
          }
        });
      }

      startAutoplay() {
        const autoplaySpeed = {{ block.settings.autoplay_speed | times: 1000 }};
        if (autoplaySpeed > 0 && {{ block.settings.enable_autoplay | json }}) {
          this.autoplayInterval = setInterval(() => {
            if (this.currentIndex >= this.maxIndex) {
              this.currentIndex = 0;
            } else {
              this.currentIndex++;
            }
            this.updateSlider();
          }, autoplaySpeed);
        }
      }

      stopAutoplay() {
        if (this.autoplayInterval) {
          clearInterval(this.autoplayInterval);
          this.autoplayInterval = null;
        }
      }

      resetAutoplay() {
        this.stopAutoplay();
        this.startAutoplay();
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        this.stopAutoplay();
      }
    }

    customElements.define('sale-products-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}', SaleProductsSlider{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

